Design the processing section for the register transfer description given below by establishing the necessary control points.

Declare registers A[4], B[4], D[4];
Declare bus outbus[4];

Start: A ← 0, B ← 0, D ← 4;
Loop: if A < B and D[0] == 0 then go to transferA
      go to Decrement;
transferA: A ← B;
      B ← A + B;
Decrement: D ← D − 1;
      if D <> 0 then go to Loop
      outbus = A;
Halt: go to Halt

Draw the complete processing section diagram for the following register transfer description indicating all the control points, inputs and outputs. List out the control points and the operation performed.

Declare registers A[4], M[4], Q[4], L[3], C[1]
Declare buses inbus[4], outbus[4]

Start: A ← 0, C ← 0, M ← inbus, L ← 4;
      Q ← inbus
Loop: if Q[0] = 1, then go to ADD
      Go to Rshift;
ADD: A ← A + M;
Rshift: LSR(C$A$Q), L ← L − 1;
      if L > 0, then go to Loop
      outbus ← A;
      outbus ← Q;
Halt: Go to Halt
